{:id :EACL-FORMAL-054
 :status :fixed
 :discovered-by :manual-review
 :seed-or-trace
 "datascript/snapshot-adapter/no-connection/fully-consistent-capability"
 :minimized-fixture "fixture.edn"
 :impact :other
 :affected-versions
 ["PR 101 through commit d1216758267d7620435c0c59cb8929bd180ab568"]
 :affected-backends [:datascript]
 :root-cause
 "DataScript's snapshot adapter advertised :fully-consistent unconditionally. Without :conn, select-authoritative fell back to the adapter's captured immutable DB and could not observe or select the current connection head."
 :fix
 "Remove :fully-consistent from an immutable DataScript adapter when :conn is absent. Preserve minimize-latency and the independently available capabilities, and cover the capability boundary with a backend regression."
 :closing-evidence
 ["eacl.datascript.consistency-v3-test/immutable-adapter-does-not-claim-authoritative-head-test"
  "ConsistencyDecision.SelectionPlanDecision"]}
